    "sentence_translations": [
      "What do you use to boil water?",
      "",
      "Recently, a video clip went viral in China.",
      "In the video, the American girl Kat and her Chinese boyfriend Sid discuss how to boil water.",
      "",
      "Kat says that in America, everyone uses a microwave to boil water.",
      "Sid think it is very strange: shouldn't you use a kettle to boil water?",
      "Kat says that in America people do not drink hot water that much.",
      "If you want coffee there are coffee machines, and if you want water you drink directly from the tap.",
      "There is very little use for a kettle.",
      "But in China, it is not very convenient to not have a kettle, because Chinese people love to drink hot water.",
      "When you get up in the morning you drink hot water, when you have a cold you drink hot water, ..",
      ".. when you have a stomach ache you drink hot water, when you drink tea you need hot water, ..",
      ".. and instant noodles require hot water.",
      "So Chinese people use a kettle to boil hot water many times per day.",
      ""
    ]
